    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### IDMS Image Registry Mirror SLO Dashboard\n\nMonitors the health of the IDMS (`imageDigestMirrors`) user journey — a customer PUT/PATCH that configures image registry mirrors, delivered to the guest cluster as `ImageDigestMirrorSet` objects.\n\n> **Scope caveat:** there is **no IDMS-specific metric today.** An `imageDigestMirrors` change is carried by the generic cluster **update** LRO, so every panel here is scoped to `operation_type=\"update\"` on `hcpopenshiftclusters` and includes authorized-CIDR changes, version upgrades, and every other cluster update. Treat these panels as the enclosing signal, not as proof an IDMS change specifically succeeded or failed. Confirm the operation is a mirror change by inspecting the cluster document.\n\n**SLO Targets (Proposed — pending baseline):**\n- Operation success rate: 95% over 7-day rolling window\n- Operation latency: complete within 2700s (45m), matching `BackendAsyncOperationClusterUpdateStuck`\n\n**Metrics Source:** `backend_resource_operation_phase_info`, `backend_resource_operation_start_time_seconds`, `backend_resource_operation_last_transition_time_seconds` (Cosmos DB-backed), plus `workqueue_*` for the `OperationClusterUpdate` controller.\n\n**Jira:** [ARO-25924](https://redhat.atlassian.net/browse/ARO-25924) | **User Journey:** [IDMS Image Registry Mirror Configuration](https://aka.ms/arohcp-runbook-idms)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "title": "Dashboard Info",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Mixed --" },
      "description": "Availability. Fraction of terminal cluster update operations in succeeded state. SLO target: 95%.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 1,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red" },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 90 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 95 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.9",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(\n  (count(max without (prometheus_replica) (backend_resource_operation_phase_info{resource_type=\"microsoft.redhatopenshift/hcpopenshiftclusters\", operation_type=\"update\", phase=\"succeeded\"})) or vector(0))\n  /\n  (count(max without (prometheus_replica) (backend_resource_operation_phase_info{resource_type=\"microsoft.redhatopenshift/hcpopenshiftclusters\", operation_type=\"update\", phase=~\"succeeded|failed\"})) > 0 or vector(1))\n) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Success Rate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Operation Success Rate",
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "seriesToRows", "options": {} },
        { "id": "merge", "options": {} }
      ],
      "type": "stat"
    },
